  "bodyText": "All Books\nGifting\nMerch\nFAQ\nLog-in / Sign-up\n🇬🇧 Shopping from the UK?\nUnbox stories worth talking about\n\nJoin the book club that’s anything but traditional. Choose up to 3 new reads every month, delivered to your door. Then dive into the stories, and the conversations.\n\nLog-in / Sign-up now\n\nShipping to the USA & Canada\n\nOur Oct books\n\nWe drop new books on the 1st of every month. Call us creatures of habit.\n\nDiscover hidden gems and buzzy new releases\n\nRead more\nVenus, Vanishing\n\nPortrait of a Lady on Fire meets The Safekeep in this gripping debut that reckons with art forgery, desire, suspicion, and resistance.\n\nDebut Novel\nHistorical\nLGBTQIA+\nRead more\nCarrying\n\nShe’s serving. She’s eating. She’s...Carrying.\n\nDebut Novel\nHorror\nLGBTQIA+\nMovie/TV Coming\nRead more\nWhat Feeds Below\n\nThe darkness isn’t empty. It’s hungry.\n\nSci-Fi\nThriller\nHorror\nRead more\nSolace House\n\nAn addictive and brilliant puzzle-box of a novel—somewhere between The Secret History and House of Leaves—following a group of university students who discover an astonishing secret while clearing out a neglected Victorian mansion.\n\nHorror\nGothic\nRead more\nLove You to Death\n\nA jaded grim reaper and a woman who wants another chance at life give ‘til death do us part a new meaning in this paranormal romance from bestselling author Jenna Levine.\n\nRomance\nFantasy\nIncludes a Cat\nRead more\nBodies of Magic\n\nGrey’s Anatomy meets A Deadly Education in this dark academia fantasy from USA Today bestselling author Freya Marske.\n\nFantasy\nMystery\nLGBTQIA+\nHow it works\n\nConsider us your professional book curator\n\nBecome a member\nStep #1\nExplore our books\n\nThe first of every month we reveal 6-7 new books. Follow us on socials to keep an eye on any hints we may post.\n\nStep #2\nBuild your\nbox\n\nMembers can order up to 3 books per box. At least one title must be from the current month's selections.\n\n\nStep #3\nCheck your doorstop\n\nYour box is delivered right to your doorstep. This is the best excuse to cancel your Friday night plans.\n\n\nStep #4\nShare your reads\n\nShare your box and tag us @aardvarkbook or participate in the Club discussions in-app!\n\n\nEach box includes a bookmark per book and postcard with a challenge to win a free credit!\n\nMade for readers by readers\n\nChoose from\n\nWe've got a book for every kind of reader\n\nHorror\nHorror\nScience Fiction\nScience Fiction\nRomance\nRomance\nThriller\nThriller\nLiterary Fiction\nLiterary Fiction\nFantasy\nFantasy\nGothic Fiction\nGothic Fiction\nHistorical Fiction\nHistorical Fiction\nMagical Realism\nMagical Realism\nContemporary Fiction\nContemporary Fiction\nand more!\nand more!\nRange of genres\nFree shipping\nAffordable\nHigh quality\nhardcovers\nCurated books\nCommon questions\nHow much does membership cost, my wallet is asking?\nWhat countries does Aardvark ship to?\nHow do I join Aardvark?\nShow all FAQ\nA gift outside of the box\nA gift outside of the box\n\nGift a subscription and they can pick their own books. No spying on shelves needed. Order today and instantly receive an e-gift card to print out or forward. If you’re lucky, they might let you borrow a copy.\n\nShop gifts!\n\nMentioned by\n\n1st book only $4 w/ code FALL (USA-only)!\n1st book only $4 w/ code FALL (USA-only)!\nMembers’ Choice Winners\n\nEvery year Aardvarkians vote on their favourite reads and we celebrate with a special reprinting. These titles have won our hearts and minds over the last few years.\n\n20\n26\nNext voting round: Fall 2026\n20\n25\n20\n24\n20\n23\nAardvark Exclusive\n\nHorror anthology by Aardvark authors.\nNo, you can't get it anywhere else.\n\nGoodreads Rating\n4.0\nAdd to box!\nOne Bad Night & Other Stories\n\nAardvark Book Club launched in October 2022, and we’re celebrating our three-year anniversary with this original horror anthology featuring past 8 Aardvark authors.\n\nAardvark Original\nHorror\nAuthors\n\nKay Chronister, Del Sandeen, Kylie Lee Baker, Rachel Harrison, CJ Leede, Jennifer Thorne, S.A. Barnes, Stephen Graham Jones\n\n\"An absolutely phenomenal anthology of short stories from some of the best voices in horror right now!\" - Trisha\n\n\"Not a bad story in the bunch. “One Bad Night” wrecked me.\" - Brittany\n\nTerms of Service\nPrivacy Policy\nJoin our mailing list\nEmail Address\nSubscribe\n©2026 Aardvark Book Club. All rights reserved.\nDesign by Dylan\nDevelopment by Future Three",
